@startuml PurchaseRequest-StateMachine
' Complete request lifecycle — README 4.1/4.2.
' Includes guards (actor/conditions), invalid transitions and terminal states.
' Implemented by domain/RequestStateMachine.java (EnumMap transition table); tested by RequestStateMachineTest.

[*] --> DRAFT : create (owner)

state DRAFT {
  DRAFT : editable working copy (owner)
}
state PENDING_APPROVAL {
  PENDING_APPROVAL : current step = min(sequence) with status PENDING
}
state CHANGES_REQUESTED {
  CHANGES_REQUESTED : editable working copy (owner)
}
state APPROVED
state REJECTED
state CANCELLED

' valid transitions (actor + condition)
DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL : submit (owner)\nitems valid; version frozen; chain built
PENDING_APPROVAL --> PENDING_APPROVAL : approve (eligible approver)\nintermediate step; advance
PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : approve (eligible approver, final step)\nbudget consumed in same tx
PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : reject (eligible approver)\ncomment >= 10 chars
PENDING_APPROVAL --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : request-changes (eligible approver)\ncomment >= 10 chars
CHANGES_REQUESTED --> PENDING_APPROVAL : submit (owner)\nNEW version frozen; chain recalculated
DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel (owner or ADMIN)
PENDING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED : cancel (owner or ADMIN)
CHANGES_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED : cancel (owner or ADMIN)

APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

' invalid transitions (explicit, evaluated by RequestStateMachine)
state "INVALID (stay in current state, 422 INVALID_TRANSITION)" as INVALID
DRAFT --> INVALID : approve / reject / request-changes
DRAFT --> INVALID : submit without items
PENDING_APPROVAL --> INVALID : edit (any user)
CHANGES_REQUESTED --> INVALID : approve / reject / request-changes
APPROVED --> INVALID : any action (final)
REJECTED --> INVALID : any action (final)
CANCELLED --> INVALID : any action (final)

' ownership violations are NOT transition errors (A-27):
' non-owner edit/submit -> 403 NOT_REQUEST_OWNER; cancel by non-owner non-ADMIN -> 403 NOT_REQUEST_OWNER
' ADMIN x foreign DRAFT: invisible -> 404 (so ADMIN cancel applies to visible states only, A-26)

note right of PENDING_APPROVAL
  Eligibility guards (422 codes):
  - SELF_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN (owner)
  - DUPLICATE_APPROVER (same person twice per version)
  - APPROVER_NOT_ELIGIBLE (role/level/CC)
  - COMMENT_REQUIRED (reject / request-changes)
  - BUDGET_EXCEEDED (final step, insufficient balance)
  No eligible approver => stays pending (NOT an error)
end note

note right of CHANGES_REQUESTED
  Previous versions immutable + queryable.
  Competence month re-stamped at resubmit.
end note
@enduml
